{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1444563-any-plans-for-vampire-the-masquerade\u2019s-30th-anniversary-2021","id":1444563,"title":"Any plans for Vampire: The Masquerade\u2019s 30th Anniversary 2021?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-04-18T16:10:49-07:00","id":1444563,"title":"Any plans for Vampire: The Masquerade\u2019s 30th Anniversary 2021?","content":"Title says it all really. <br /> <br /> Vampire: the Masquerade was originally released in the latter half of 1991, so is anybody doing any official release or celebration for this? White Wolf/Paradox? The Onyx Path? Anybody else?!<br /> <br /> Do people have any wishes? <br /> <br /> Mine would be, at least, a release of the VTM 1st Edition as a POD that has been hovering around drivethrurrpg for a while now.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2517-trippy","name":"Trippy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2517_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1018"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-18T17:39:11-07:00","id":1444573,"title":"","content":"Probably not this close to the release of V5.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1208-grumpy-rpg-reviews","name":"Grumpy RPG Reviews","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1208_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-18T17:45:03-07:00","id":1444574,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Grumpy RPG Reviews</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1444563-any-plans-for-vampire-the-masquerade\u2019s-30th-anniversary-2021?p=1444573#post1444573\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Probably not this close to the release of V5.</div> </div> </div> </div>Probably not what this close to the release of V5?<br /> <br /> V5 was released back in 2018. Do all plans to celebrate an anniversary cease if a new edition is released within 5 years of a new edition? You\u2019ll note, I'm not expecting or talking about a new edition here. I\u2019m asking what plans do companies/people have to celebrate a milestone in the game\u2019s history.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2517,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2517-trippy","user":"Trippy","date":". 04-18-2021, 08:47 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2517-trippy","name":"Trippy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2517_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1018"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-18T22:28:36-07:00","id":1444599,"title":"","content":"Sabbat book. Maybe just a small community post if nothing else.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><div align=\"left\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/7.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26764-vilenecromancer","name":"Vilenecromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26764_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"247"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-19T00:12:01-07:00","id":1444603,"title":"","content":"I was actually attempting something stupidly over-ambitious for the storytellers vault at some point before realizing what a lunatic i was being and decided to do it peacemeal. It would probably be a fan 'v30' if i manage to release enough of it this year. Alas I still havent released the Discipline module i expected to release January for a number of reasons, but I have sizable drafts for sects, backgrounds, most clans and core rules.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-19T06:48:38-07:00","id":1444645,"title":"","content":"I think I might write an open letter to White Wolf/Paradox that the Vampire community doesn\u2019t seem to care about the 30th Anniversary or think it is worth celebrating. That is the impression I am getting here.<br /> <br /> I note that Call of Cthulhu\u2019s 40th Anniversary is already getting a buzz about Chaosium\u2019s plans - but I guess that community is more passionate about it. Outside of edition wars, perhaps.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2517-trippy","name":"Trippy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2517_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1018"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-19T07:08:09-07:00","id":1444649,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Trippy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1444563-any-plans-for-vampire-the-masquerade\u2019s-30th-anniversary-2021?p=1444645#post1444645\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think I might write an open letter to White Wolf/Paradox that the Vampire community doesn\u2019t seem to care about the 30th Anniversary or think it is worth celebrating. That is the impression I am getting here.<br /> <br /> I note that Call of Cthulhu\u2019s 40th Anniversary is already getting a buzz about Chaosium\u2019s plans - but I guess that community is more passionate about it. Outside of edition wars, perhaps.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Why would you write to Paradox to tell them the community doesn't care? That seems like a bizarre thing to do.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#000080\">Matthew Dawkins</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000080\">In-House Developer for Onyx Path Publishing</span></b><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b><span style=\"color:#008080\">Website: </span><a href=\"http://www.matthewdawkins.com\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.matthewdawkins.com</span></a><br /> <span style=\"color:#008080\">Patreon: </span><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins</span></a></b></span></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/152-the-gentleman-gamer","name":"The Gentleman Gamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1698"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-19T07:09:05-07:00","id":1444652,"title":"","content":"It's not that we don't want it, it's just unrealistic. First, there's not that much confidence in WoD products right now. Second, It would be cutting into v5's questionable performance; even if you're competing with yourself, you'll want the numbers to look good. It's why Coke stopped making new coke when it was supposedly a better product, because the split'd make pepsi the number 1 product, or why you should never vote for third parties in a two party system... where was i? Oh, third, because what would we actually want from a V30? You would most likely want V5.1 while on the other end many would want something that entirely ignores v5 and just puts some polish onto v20, maybe lean a little heavier on 2nd rather than revised edition, and then there are those in the middle who would want something imbetween like v20 mechanics and V5 metaplot, or requiem mechanics and v20 metaplot, or... Just what exactly are you asking for when you say &quot;V30&quot;?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-19T07:13:38-07:00","id":1444654,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Trippy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1444563-any-plans-for-vampire-the-masquerade\u2019s-30th-anniversary-2021?p=1444645#post1444645\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think I might write an open letter to White Wolf/Paradox that the Vampire community doesn\u2019t seem to care about the 30th Anniversary or think it is worth celebrating. That is the impression I am getting here.<br /> <br /> I note that Call of Cthulhu\u2019s 40th Anniversary is already getting a buzz about Chaosium\u2019s plans - but I guess that community is more passionate about it. Outside of edition wars, perhaps.</div> </div> </div> </div>I care, but A) I wasn\u2019t around back then and B) it seems like the game keeps getting better with each edition, so the 1st ed would probably be the worst.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-19T07:30:35-07:00","id":1444660,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Penelope</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1444563-any-plans-for-vampire-the-masquerade\u2019s-30th-anniversary-2021?p=1444654#post1444654\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I care, but A) I wasn\u2019t around back then and B) it seems like the game keeps getting better with each edition, so the 1st ed would probably be the worst.</div> </div> </div> </div>Eh, without talking about the most recent editions.. the first three editions are a bit two steps back, three steps forward. I wasn't around, but I understand there was some notable kickback with Revised. Having being introduced to the game with 20th and then going back in time through the books, I've gotta say there's certainly some things 1/2 did better than revised (aggravated damage, diablerie mechanics, which clans were in the cam, certain discipline powers, some morality stuff and a few miscelania )<br /> Also 1e is a nicely concise book with a good layout.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-19T11:22:37-07:00","id":1444682,"title":"","content":"Perhaps they could finally get around to making a Kindred of the East V20, now that it is time for V30.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/727-thoth","name":"Thoth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar727_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1689"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-19T12:49:19-07:00","id":1444702,"title":"","content":"Something cool at gen Con would be fun. A special event of some sort.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3901-radiofreedeath","name":"RadioFreeDeath","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"177"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-19T14:01:52-07:00","id":1444711,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Gentleman Gamer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1444563-any-plans-for-vampire-the-masquerade\u2019s-30th-anniversary-2021?p=1444649#post1444649\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Why would you write to Paradox to tell them the community doesn't care? That seems like a bizarre thing to do.</div> </div> </div> </div><i>Open </i>letter......and I am happy to see people prove me wrong here.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2517-trippy","name":"Trippy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2517_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1018"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-19T14:04:48-07:00","id":1444712,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1444563-any-plans-for-vampire-the-masquerade\u2019s-30th-anniversary-2021?p=1444652#post1444652\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's not that we don't want it, it's just unrealistic. First, there's not that much confidence in WoD products right now. Second, It would be cutting into v5's questionable performance; even if you're competing with yourself, you'll want the numbers to look good. It's why Coke stopped making new coke when it was supposedly a better product, because the split'd make pepsi the number 1 product, or why you should never vote for third parties in a two party system... where was i? Oh, third, because what would we actually want from a V30? You would most likely want V5.1 while on the other end many would want something that entirely ignores v5 and just puts some polish onto v20, maybe lean a little heavier on 2nd rather than revised edition, and then there are those in the middle who would want something imbetween like v20 mechanics and V5 metaplot, or requiem mechanics and v20 metaplot, or... Just what exactly are you asking for when you say &quot;V30&quot;?</div> </div> </div> </div>As I said before, I am not suggesting that the game needs to release a new edition - I am merely asking what people are seeking to do to celebrate the 30th Anniversary.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2517-trippy","name":"Trippy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2517_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1018"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-19T14:12:48-07:00","id":1444713,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Penelope</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1444563-any-plans-for-vampire-the-masquerade\u2019s-30th-anniversary-2021?p=1444654#post1444654\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I care, but A) I wasn\u2019t around back then and B) it seems like the game keeps getting better with each edition, so the 1st ed would probably be the worst.</div> </div> </div> </div>Have you read it? Is there not even an interest to see how the game was like originally? <br /> <br /> The manuscript is already there as a PDF on drivethrurpg, but needs a POD release to fall in line with the 1st editions of Werewolf, Mage and Wraith currently. <br /> <br /> Beyond this, it is just a single idea - you could also, for example, have a limited printing run of the current edition with a commemorative 30th Anniversary cover - maybe a slight variation on the old, iconic 1st edition? You could just announce a discount sale on existing titles on drivethrurrpg.com. You could just organize an online party. All could be used to publicize the game and celebrate its history. If you do <i>nothing</i> though, what does this suggest to the wider hobby how fans feel about the game?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2517-trippy","name":"Trippy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2517_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1018"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-23T06:24:56-07:00","id":1445473,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1444563-any-plans-for-vampire-the-masquerade\u2019s-30th-anniversary-2021?p=1444603#post1444603\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I was actually attempting something stupidly over-ambitious for the storytellers vault at some point before realizing what a lunatic i was being and decided to do it peacemeal. It would probably be a fan 'v30' if i manage to release enough of it this year. Alas I still havent released the Discipline module i expected to release January for a number of reasons, but I have sizable drafts for sects, backgrounds, most clans and core rules.</div> </div> </div> </div>Snap. I've gotten most of it done but it's been a lot of work. We're playtesting the rules now.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}